WEBVTT

00:00:01.180 --> 00:00:04.790
Inazuma Eleven GO is about to start!

00:00:07.820 --> 00:00:12.270
We've got to do what we can with the nine members left at Raimon's soccer club.

00:00:15.750 --> 00:00:17.070
You mean ten members.

00:00:22.020 --> 00:00:23.140
Chairman!

00:00:23.140 --> 00:00:26.000
Tsurugi-kun is joining the soccer club.

00:00:27.900 --> 00:00:30.170
Good to be on the team...

00:00:30.890 --> 00:00:31.760
Captain.

00:00:37.990 --> 00:00:40.720
Now, give Tsurugi-kun his uniform.

00:00:46.390 --> 00:00:47.940
Go on.

00:00:57.210 --> 00:00:58.870
Do you know what you just did?!

00:00:58.870 --> 00:01:00.240
That's the Raimon uniform!

00:01:00.700 --> 00:01:03.760
I'm an observer from Fifth Sector.

00:01:03.760 --> 00:01:05.690
I'm not like you.

00:01:05.690 --> 00:01:07.220
Tsurugi!

00:01:07.220 --> 00:01:08.260
Stop, Shindou!

00:01:09.100 --> 00:01:10.420
But...

00:01:10.770 --> 00:01:12.130
Shindou.

00:01:14.900 --> 00:01:18.080
W-Well, since it appears that introductions are over...

00:01:18.080 --> 00:01:20.050
That's how it is.

00:03:15.390 --> 00:03:17.210
Okay, it's blue today!

00:03:21.970 --> 00:03:22.410
Go!

00:03:37.590 --> 00:03:38.350
Goal!

00:03:39.470 --> 00:03:42.260
Yes! That's gotta be my best record!

00:03:42.260 --> 00:03:43.550
Tenma!

00:03:44.960 --> 00:03:45.820
Shinsuke!

00:03:46.510 --> 00:03:50.640
You're here half an hour early and you're already practicing?

00:03:50.640 --> 00:03:52.920
Yeah! I just couldn't wait any longer!

00:03:54.210 --> 00:03:55.330
Actually, neither could I!

00:03:55.750 --> 00:03:57.710
Let's do our best in today's entrance exam!

00:03:58.440 --> 00:03:59.170
Yeah!

00:03:59.480 --> 00:04:02.480
We'll train until school starts!

00:04:02.480 --> 00:04:03.530
Okay!

00:04:05.080 --> 00:04:08.420
This is actually my second time trying out for an entrance exam.

00:04:08.420 --> 00:04:09.220
Really?

00:04:09.550 --> 00:04:10.290
Yeah.

00:04:10.290 --> 00:04:15.240
I tried out for the youth soccer team back in elementary school, but I didn't pass.

00:04:15.240 --> 00:04:16.290
I see.

00:04:16.290 --> 00:04:18.600
Then let's pass it this time, together!

00:04:18.600 --> 00:04:19.420
Yeah!

00:04:22.750 --> 00:04:24.630
School is starting!

00:04:24.630 --> 00:04:26.780
We lost track of time!

00:04:32.380 --> 00:04:34.550
We only have nine members left.

00:04:34.550 --> 00:04:36.900
What's more, that Tsurugi is joining.

00:04:37.560 --> 00:04:40.100
How do I protect the soccer club?

00:04:40.100 --> 00:04:42.050
What can I do as captain?

00:04:42.510 --> 00:04:45.670
Shindou, don't put this all on yourself.

00:04:45.670 --> 00:04:48.510
You aren't the only one worrying about the soccer club.

00:04:49.050 --> 00:04:52.640
If Tsurugi ever tries that again, I'll knock him flat!

00:04:53.080 --> 00:04:54.450
Calm down, Amagi.

00:04:54.450 --> 00:04:55.310
But...!

00:04:56.070 --> 00:04:59.770
An observer from Fifth Sector could never understand how we feel.

00:05:05.780 --> 00:05:08.440
Wish we could play soccer as freely as we wanted...

00:05:08.980 --> 00:05:09.750
Yeah...

00:05:13.640 --> 00:05:20.150
It was two years ago, when we first joined, that soccer managed by Fifth Sector began.

00:05:22.990 --> 00:05:27.010
We couldn't accept that Fifth Sector decided who was to win or lose a game,

00:05:27.240 --> 00:05:30.720
so we fought back while at a loss on how to put things to rights.

00:05:32.500 --> 00:05:35.070
But it was all for nothing.

00:05:41.790 --> 00:05:45.410
Even so, we chose to keep playing soccer.

00:05:48.520 --> 00:05:50.380
Get over it already.

00:05:51.420 --> 00:05:54.080
No one can win against Fifth Sector.

00:05:54.080 --> 00:05:56.080
We know that.

00:05:56.080 --> 00:05:59.120
And that we have to listen to them if we want to keep playing soccer.

00:05:59.120 --> 00:06:01.980
Then put up with it for one more year.

00:06:01.980 --> 00:06:06.650
At least our three years of soccer here will look good when we apply for high school.

00:06:11.810 --> 00:06:16.020
Not all of us can just get over it like you can!

00:06:19.190 --> 00:06:26.570
Mankind has currently found over 100 chemical elements, each with their own name, atomic number, and symbol.

00:06:27.320 --> 00:06:32.670
In the very back of your textbooks, you should find a table which is called the periodic table.

00:06:32.670 --> 00:06:36.850
It has elements with similar properties grouped together according to their group numbers.

00:06:43.690 --> 00:06:44.960
Whoa!

00:06:48.150 --> 00:06:50.760
I wish school ended already!

00:06:50.760 --> 00:06:52.660
They sure are in high spirits.

00:06:52.660 --> 00:06:54.990
Today's the entrance exam, isn't it?

00:06:55.760 --> 00:06:57.000
Seto-senpai!

00:06:57.000 --> 00:06:58.440
You can call me Midori.

00:06:58.440 --> 00:07:00.540
Okay, Midori-san.

00:07:01.290 --> 00:07:02.900
Nice, isn't he?

00:07:03.350 --> 00:07:04.600
Do you mean Tenma?

00:07:04.600 --> 00:07:05.270
Yeah.

00:07:05.760 --> 00:07:10.810
He doesn't look reliable on the outside, but he's got himself somethin' fierce right here.

00:07:10.810 --> 00:07:12.370
Yeah. It's nice.

00:07:13.240 --> 00:07:15.670
Let's pass that entrance exam!

00:07:15.670 --> 00:07:17.620
Yeah! We'll pass it!

00:07:17.820 --> 00:07:19.250
It's too high!

00:07:19.670 --> 00:07:22.300
We're gonna be soccer players!

00:07:22.300 --> 00:07:23.390
He reached it!

00:07:25.420 --> 00:07:26.420
Shinsuke!

00:07:27.200 --> 00:07:28.420
I-I'm okay.

00:07:28.840 --> 00:07:30.420
He shows promise too.

00:07:31.460 --> 00:07:33.200
Let's keep going, Tenma!

00:07:33.200 --> 00:07:35.100
Yeah, let's do our best.

00:07:36.470 --> 00:07:38.180
That's the guy from yesterday.

00:07:38.180 --> 00:07:39.720
He's all fired up.

00:07:40.180 --> 00:07:42.510
Matsukaze Tenma, was it?

00:07:42.510 --> 00:07:44.510
I think he's annoying.

00:07:44.510 --> 00:07:47.730
What's the point of joining the club in this situation?

00:07:54.500 --> 00:07:56.070
What can I do?

00:07:57.390 --> 00:07:59.470
There's nothing I can do.

00:08:00.350 --> 00:08:01.040
Nothing.

00:08:02.890 --> 00:08:04.890
Class is starting, Shindou.

00:08:05.700 --> 00:08:06.790
Sangoku-san!

00:08:08.910 --> 00:08:10.370
This is my fault!

00:08:10.370 --> 00:08:13.970
As captain, I'm supposed to be protecting the soccer club!

00:08:13.970 --> 00:08:15.970
It's not your fault.

00:08:15.970 --> 00:08:18.510
They came here to destroy our soccer club.

00:08:18.510 --> 00:08:20.630
We had no choice but to accept their challenge.

00:08:20.630 --> 00:08:25.740
But... I made a promise to you and the other upperclassmen...

00:08:27.900 --> 00:08:29.480
Me, be captain?

00:08:29.950 --> 00:08:32.680
Stand at the front and bring up the soccer club with you.

00:08:32.680 --> 00:08:35.340
I can't, I'm just a first-year!

00:08:35.340 --> 00:08:37.240
You ought to do it instead!

00:08:37.240 --> 00:08:39.130
Listen to me, Shindou.

00:08:39.130 --> 00:08:44.080
Right now, the JHS soccer world is controlled by Fifth Sector, including their wins and losses.

00:08:45.240 --> 00:08:49.390
Winning the national tournament these days is just for the sake of going through the motions.

00:08:49.390 --> 00:08:54.550
But even so, we couldn't completely give up on aiming to be the best in the truest sense.

00:08:56.200 --> 00:09:04.380
One day, when this system no longer exists, you have to make the team strong so they can win at the national level.

00:09:04.380 --> 00:09:08.830
For that to happen, Shindou, we need you to be our captain.

00:09:08.830 --> 00:09:10.880
But I don't have that sort of ability-

00:09:10.880 --> 00:09:11.970
You do!

00:09:11.970 --> 00:09:18.610
You have a talent at bringing the team together like a conductor who waves his baton in an orchestra.

00:09:18.610 --> 00:09:23.250
Once you're able to use that ability as captain, it will make Raimon stronger.

00:09:23.980 --> 00:09:25.810
It has to be you!

00:09:27.170 --> 00:09:28.100
Shindou!

00:09:33.340 --> 00:09:34.260
I understand.

00:09:38.050 --> 00:09:40.720
I couldn't do it.

00:09:40.970 --> 00:09:44.000
I couldn't accomplish anything as captain.

00:09:44.000 --> 00:09:44.930
Anything...

00:09:46.370 --> 00:09:49.400
Even so, I believe in you.

00:09:54.890 --> 00:09:58.040
Tenma, Shinsuke! Lunch break is over!

00:09:58.040 --> 00:10:00.370
Classes are about to start in five minutes!

00:10:02.080 --> 00:10:03.080
Okay!

00:10:16.850 --> 00:10:17.540
Tenma!

00:10:25.330 --> 00:10:27.630
I'm joining the soccer club.

00:10:29.300 --> 00:10:30.600
Whatever you say.

00:10:32.360 --> 00:10:33.740
Let's go, Tenma.

00:10:33.740 --> 00:10:34.570
Okay.

00:10:41.470 --> 00:10:44.760
He's so good at soccer, so why...?

00:10:47.400 --> 00:10:48.700
Don't worry about it.

00:10:48.700 --> 00:10:50.310
O-Okay.

00:10:52.410 --> 00:10:54.290
Oh no! Hurry up, everyone!

00:10:55.170 --> 00:10:56.990
That's right, hurry along.

00:10:59.150 --> 00:11:01.090
The entrance exam, huh?

00:11:02.480 --> 00:11:04.000
Are you worried?

00:11:04.000 --> 00:11:05.100
No.

00:11:09.160 --> 00:11:10.410
Did you hear?

00:11:10.410 --> 00:11:15.480
The soccer club got wiped out by one new student.

00:11:15.480 --> 00:11:17.240
Yeah, I heard.

00:11:17.240 --> 00:11:20.360
They got owned by those guys called the Black Knights, right?

00:11:20.360 --> 00:11:26.520
I was thinking of joining, but a soccer club like that will just look bad on my student record.

00:11:26.520 --> 00:11:29.290
It's a good thing you found out the truth before you joined.

00:11:29.290 --> 00:11:30.080
Yeah.

00:11:30.080 --> 00:11:33.960
They don't even know anything about Fifth Sector...!

00:11:35.460 --> 00:11:42.890
Inazuma Eleven GO!

00:11:54.390 --> 00:11:55.850
I'm Sorano Aoi.

00:11:55.850 --> 00:11:58.060
I'd like to join as a manager.

00:12:00.080 --> 00:12:02.740
Manager... of the soccer club?

00:12:03.270 --> 00:12:04.000
Yes!

00:12:04.000 --> 00:12:05.260
I-I see.

00:12:05.890 --> 00:12:06.990
Thank you.

00:12:06.990 --> 00:12:09.250
In that case, it's good to have you.

00:12:09.250 --> 00:12:10.660
Thank you! I'll do my best!

00:12:14.030 --> 00:12:16.360
I'm Yamana Akane.

00:12:16.360 --> 00:12:18.920
It's nice to meet you, Aoi-chan.

00:12:19.850 --> 00:12:22.520
We'll begin the entrance exam starting now.

00:12:22.520 --> 00:12:23.960
Matsukaze Tenma.

00:12:23.960 --> 00:12:24.590
Yes, sir!

00:12:25.190 --> 00:12:26.730
Nishizono Shinsuke.

00:12:26.730 --> 00:12:27.390
Yes, sir!

00:12:27.950 --> 00:12:29.480
Kotegawa Sakio.

00:12:29.480 --> 00:12:30.760
Yes, sir.

00:12:30.760 --> 00:12:32.060
Oshii Tsuyoshi.

00:12:32.060 --> 00:12:33.430
Yes, sir!

00:12:33.430 --> 00:12:34.990
Kanari Atsunori.

00:12:34.990 --> 00:12:35.400
Yes, sir!

00:12:36.380 --> 00:12:42.430
All of you will be playing as if you were in a real game, and your actions will determine whether you pass or fail.

00:12:42.430 --> 00:12:42.860
Yes, sir!

00:12:43.870 --> 00:12:47.160
I expected as much, but these are it, huh?

00:12:48.160 --> 00:12:51.340
No matter who joins, it won't change anything.

00:12:52.120 --> 00:12:53.500
Nothing can be done.

00:12:54.210 --> 00:12:56.090
Tenma, you can do it!

00:12:56.090 --> 00:12:58.190
Go show 'em, Tenma!

00:12:58.190 --> 00:12:59.000
Midori-san?

00:13:06.150 --> 00:13:10.240
The five of you will go up against our second and third-years.

00:13:10.240 --> 00:13:11.890
You can play whatever way you wish.

00:13:12.130 --> 00:13:14.470
Let's do our best and pass together!

00:13:14.470 --> 00:13:15.270
Yeah!

00:13:18.660 --> 00:13:22.340
The soccer club only has ten members right now.

00:13:22.340 --> 00:13:24.000
There's no way they'll let me fail.

00:13:24.510 --> 00:13:28.700
If I join now, it'll look like I'm the one who saved the soccer club.

00:13:28.700 --> 00:13:31.490
That'll make me look good in front of the teachers.

00:13:37.710 --> 00:13:41.840
The famous soccer club may be dropping fast, but a regular is still a regular.

00:13:45.630 --> 00:13:46.800
Where do you think you're aiming?

00:13:47.270 --> 00:13:49.300
It's your trapping that sucks!

00:13:54.050 --> 00:13:56.790
Hey, think about how much kick you're using!

00:14:00.230 --> 00:14:01.850
This is the level they're at, huh?

00:14:03.470 --> 00:14:05.980
Don't worry, it's only just started!

00:14:07.920 --> 00:14:08.910
Here.

00:14:09.850 --> 00:14:10.650
Huh?

00:14:12.710 --> 00:14:14.990
It was such an easy pass.

00:14:17.110 --> 00:14:19.320
Shinsuke, relax yourself!

00:14:19.320 --> 00:14:20.330
O-Okay...

00:14:23.040 --> 00:14:23.420
Here!

00:14:25.690 --> 00:14:26.340
Here I go!

00:14:26.940 --> 00:14:28.340
Go, Tenma!

00:14:31.820 --> 00:14:32.930
He did it!

00:14:33.540 --> 00:14:35.350
Not bad, I guess.

00:14:37.820 --> 00:14:39.230
Captain Shindou!

00:14:39.660 --> 00:14:43.230
Are you serious when you say you'll pass?

00:14:43.760 --> 00:14:44.550
Yes!

00:14:44.550 --> 00:14:46.750
I want to join!

00:14:46.750 --> 00:14:48.470
I want to play soccer in Raimon!

00:14:50.130 --> 00:14:52.780
There is no soccer here!

00:14:54.990 --> 00:14:56.190
Tenma!

00:14:54.990 --> 00:14:56.190
Shin-sama?

00:14:54.990 --> 00:14:56.190
What's his deal?

00:14:58.350 --> 00:15:00.090
Why is he getting so worked up?

00:15:01.080 --> 00:15:02.090
Shindou...

00:15:04.470 --> 00:15:08.780
Just liking soccer won't get you far in this world.

00:15:09.580 --> 00:15:12.000
You're amazing, Captain!

00:15:12.770 --> 00:15:14.920
Guess I won't get past you that easily.

00:15:15.530 --> 00:15:17.100
But I won't give up!

00:15:19.070 --> 00:15:20.560
Try it if you can.

00:15:21.000 --> 00:15:21.900
Okay!

00:15:30.330 --> 00:15:33.040
Tch! The captain's being serious!

00:15:33.040 --> 00:15:35.460
It's because that guy made him mad.

00:15:35.460 --> 00:15:36.780
I'm not dealing with this.

00:15:39.820 --> 00:15:42.960
He's so fast, I couldn't even tell when he took the ball.

00:15:46.980 --> 00:15:50.470
Maybe it was impossible, thinking we could pass...

00:15:50.990 --> 00:15:52.760
It's not over yet, Shinsuke!

00:15:53.380 --> 00:15:54.870
Tenma!

00:15:54.870 --> 00:15:55.350
But...

00:15:55.650 --> 00:15:56.830
I won't give up!

00:15:56.830 --> 00:15:59.660
As long as I don't give up, it'll work out somehow!

00:15:59.660 --> 00:16:00.430
Here I go!

00:16:14.610 --> 00:16:15.320
I'm not done yet!

00:16:18.070 --> 00:16:19.040
Tenma...

00:16:20.400 --> 00:16:22.230
He doesn't have to go that far...

00:16:22.230 --> 00:16:24.500
That's it, teach him a lesson!

00:16:26.950 --> 00:16:29.130
Tenma... Shinsuke...

00:16:56.530 --> 00:16:57.530
Shinsuke!

00:16:58.900 --> 00:17:00.190
I won't give up either!

00:17:10.630 --> 00:17:11.800
Okay!

00:17:18.500 --> 00:17:24.400
No matter how much the struggle, real soccer just keeps getting farther and farther from sight.

00:17:31.600 --> 00:17:32.770
It's not over yet.

00:17:32.770 --> 00:17:33.360
Yeah!

00:17:47.410 --> 00:17:48.420
Tenma!

00:17:49.480 --> 00:17:52.850
I won't ever... give up!

00:18:03.040 --> 00:18:03.700
All right!

00:18:13.750 --> 00:18:14.480
So close!

00:18:14.890 --> 00:18:17.950
No matter how hard you work, there are just some things that won't come to you.

00:18:18.420 --> 00:18:19.580
I'm not...

00:18:21.650 --> 00:18:22.950
I'm not done yet...

00:18:23.320 --> 00:18:26.660
You think that as long as you don't give up, your wishes will come true?

00:18:30.540 --> 00:18:31.170
Yes!

00:18:32.960 --> 00:18:34.590
You don't know anything!

00:19:05.820 --> 00:19:08.720
I-I've got the ball...

00:19:09.900 --> 00:19:13.540
This time... I'll get past...

00:19:15.870 --> 00:19:16.980
Tenma!

00:19:20.560 --> 00:19:21.630
That's enough.

00:19:21.630 --> 00:19:22.890
The exam is over.

00:19:24.700 --> 00:19:26.030
That's all they've got.

00:19:32.980 --> 00:19:34.650
I will now announce the results.

00:19:35.420 --> 00:19:36.690
Those who've passed are...

00:19:37.030 --> 00:19:38.790
Zero.

00:19:38.790 --> 00:19:40.900
They've all failed.

00:19:44.860 --> 00:19:46.430
Matsukaze Tenma.

00:19:47.200 --> 00:19:48.590
Nishizono Shinsuke.

00:19:51.190 --> 00:19:52.700
Those two. That's all.

00:19:53.470 --> 00:19:54.940
No fair!

00:19:54.940 --> 00:19:56.410
Why are they the only ones?!

00:20:00.600 --> 00:20:02.330
I thought I was a shoo-in.

00:20:02.670 --> 00:20:04.470
Whatever, I didn't want to join anyway.

00:20:04.470 --> 00:20:06.430
The Raimon soccer club is finished.

00:20:06.930 --> 00:20:09.530
Why did those losers get to pass?

00:20:09.530 --> 00:20:11.390
In other words, that means...

00:20:11.620 --> 00:20:14.100
You guys are worse than losers.

00:20:19.340 --> 00:20:21.030
Ouch!

00:20:21.790 --> 00:20:22.920
That means...

00:20:22.920 --> 00:20:24.000
It's not a dream!

00:20:24.400 --> 00:20:26.810
Congratulations, Tenma, Shinsuke!

00:20:26.810 --> 00:20:27.640
Yeah!

00:20:30.870 --> 00:20:32.490
I'm Matsukaze Tenma.

00:20:32.490 --> 00:20:34.080
I'm Nishizono Shinsuke.

00:20:34.520 --> 00:20:35.880
We're glad to be here!

00:20:36.470 --> 00:20:38.540
Yeah, same here.

00:20:39.640 --> 00:20:41.300
What the hell.

00:20:42.300 --> 00:20:43.180
Coach!

00:20:44.610 --> 00:20:47.220
Why did you let those two pass?

00:20:47.220 --> 00:20:49.560
They should've failed like the other three!

00:20:50.550 --> 00:20:52.750
Didn't you feel it?

00:20:52.750 --> 00:20:54.230
F-Feel what?{mune ni God Hand, of course}

00:20:54.860 --> 00:20:58.150
Matsukaze Tenma. Nishizono Shinsuke.

00:20:58.600 --> 00:21:00.960
It had to be those two.

00:21:00.960 --> 00:21:01.900
That's everything.

00:21:02.270 --> 00:21:04.070
That's not an answer!

00:21:04.560 --> 00:21:06.870
You will understand in due time, Shindou.

00:21:12.950 --> 00:21:15.260
It's you who doesn't understand, Coach!

00:21:16.030 --> 00:21:19.240
There's nothing I or anybody else can do!

00:21:20.540 --> 00:21:24.560
Nothing can save Raimon's soccer club!

00:22:54.060 --> 00:22:56.180
We immediately get a practice match set up!

00:22:56.180 --> 00:22:59.220
But something seems wrong with the upperclassmen.

00:22:59.220 --> 00:23:03.190
Next on Inazuma Eleven GO, 
 The Fixed Match

00:23:03.190 --> 00:23:05.110
This is super-dimensional soccer!

00:23:15.110 --> 00:23:17.910
The Inazuma Eleven GO's proverb today is...

